BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w1-s0-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T161414Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:≈ Swim session 1\, 07:00 Sloterparkbad (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Swim session 1\, 07:00 Sloterparkbad - 50 m pool\, lanes 07:0
 0-08:00\, before work. Warm-up 100 m easy + 10 bobs (in through the mout
 h only\, out through mouth and nose\, hard puff just before you turn). C
 ool-down 100 m easy. Main set easy\, about 40 s per 25 m\, breathe every
  2nd stroke\; if the panic starts\, stand\, 3-4 slow breaths\, carry on.
  Press lap at every stop and set the pool size. Drills (breathing): side
  kick 4 x 25\, 6-1-6 2 x 25\, catch-up 2 x 25. Main: 8 x 25 with 30 s re
 st\, then 2 x 50 with 60 s rest.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. V
 ertical jump comes back about 18 days after an ultra\, which is Thursday
 \, so the running is all easy and the first box jumps start low. Durabil
 ity is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min ar
 e what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run le
 g in one sentence.\n159 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w1-s1-push@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T161414Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Strength UPPER (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER - push and pull as one session\, 45 min. Rows\
 , pull-ups\, overhead press\, rear delts. Heavy\, 4-6 reps\, not hypertr
 ophy ranges. Free against the running and cycling load. Dead hangs 3 x m
 ax at the end - grip is a genuine weakness at 32-36 s.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 -
  Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump comes back about 18 days after an ult
 ra\, which is Thursday\, so the running is all easy and the first box ju
 mps start low. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: long s
 essions over 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\, wh
 ich is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n159 days to Venice 70.3 (winte
 r base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
