 -down 100 m easy. Main set easy\, about 40 s per 25 m\, breathe every 2n
 d stroke\; if the panic starts\, stand\, 3-4 slow breaths\, carry on. Pr
 ess lap at every stop and set the pool size. Drills (arms): catch-up 2 x
  25\, one-arm freestyle 4 x 25\, fingertip drag 2 x 25. Main: 4 x 75 wit
 h 45 s rest\, then try 1 x 100.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Ve
 rtical jump comes back about 18 days after an ultra\, which is Thursday\
 , so the running is all easy and the first box jumps start low. Durabili
 ty is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min are
  what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run leg
  in one sentence.\n154 days to Venice 70.3 (winter base).
