 st)\; then this week's continuous-swim set from the Sunday swim\, easy. 
 Cool-down 100 m. 50 m pool\, lanes 07:00-08:00\, before work.\n\nWeek 3 
 of 11 - Threshold\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK opens. Pfitzinger's order: threshold 
 first\, VO2max later in the block. Two quality touches this week - Tuesd
 ay's session and a threshold finish on the long run. Quality volume stay
