SUMMARY:○ BIKE 50 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady.…
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 50 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady. Non-impact aerobi
 c volume - the cheapest fitness available and it spares the shins.\n\nWe
 ek 3 of 11 - Threshold\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK opens. Pfitzinger's order: thres
 hold first\, VO2max later in the block. Two quality touches this week - 
 Tuesday's session and a threshold finish on the long run. Quality volume
  stays inside 20-25% of weekly mileage\, which is the Norwegian rule and
  the one that keeps this repeatable.\n140 days to Venice 70.3 (winter ba
 se).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
