 -1-6\, catch-up\, one-arm\, fingertip drag - whichever still feels harde
 st)\; then this week's continuous-swim set from the Sunday swim\, easy. 
 Cool-down 100 m. 50 m pool\, lanes 07:00-08:00\, before work. Holiday we
 ek: check the pool's holiday hours in the app.\n\nWeek 7 of 11 - Build\n
