BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:venice703winterbase-w7-s5-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T161414Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 45 min. Back squat 4 x 3-5 at 85-90%
  1RM\, safety pins on (75 x 5 on 13 Nov puts the 1RM near 88-90 kg: 4 x 
 4 at 80 kg on 20 Nov\, then add 2.5 kg when the last set moves well). Ha
 ck squat if there's no rack or you're wrecked. Then Bulgarian split squa
 t 3 x 5/leg heavy\, single-leg calf raises 3 x 8 loaded\, Nordic curls 2
  x 4. COMPLEX PAIRING: after each heavy set\, 5 box jumps or 20 m of bou
 nds within 2 min - heavy resistance plus plyo beats either alone for run
 ning economy. Heavy loads at or above 90% 1RM give greater economy gains
  than lighter ones\, and the effect needs 10-14 weeks\, which is exactly
  this block. LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, 5 min: tibialis anterior raises 3 x 15
 -20\, heel walks 2 x 20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10\, short-foot h
 olds 3 x 30 s per side.\n\nWeek 7 of 11 - Build\nBUILD. VO2max enters no
 w - 3-5 min efforts\, the range where you accumulate real time at maxima
 l oxygen uptake. Biggest running week of the block.\n114 days to Venice 
 70.3 (winter base).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
