 ike is over half a 70.3 by time.\n\nWeek 10 of 11 - Bridge\nBRIDGE to Ve
 nice. Durability leads: the long run and the bike carry the block from h
 ere\, and the running holds rather than builds.\n94 days to Venice 70.3 
